      "releaseNotes": "Corrects a typo in app version number sequence. Fixes a bug in sensing a Caroline North broadcast to set and unset its stream button. Fixes text formatting issues in presenter profiles. Adds 'Auto' ability to slideshow. Adds link to WhatsApp on 'Contact' page.",
